page Download() {
  return ASX {
    <Head>
      <Title>Download the Legura pilot | Legura</Title>
    </Head>
    <section class="interior-hero section-wrap">
      <span class="section-kicker">GET LEGURA</span>
      <h1>Try the<br /><em>Legura pilot.</em></h1>
      <p>Download the experimental 0.0.2 pilot for a local evaluation. The native packages do not require Rust, Cargo, Node.js or Docker to run. They are unsigned and are not supported production installers.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="section-wrap download-grid">
      <article class="download-card download-card--primary">
        <span class="download-card__label">WINDOWS / X64</span>
        <h2>Windows ZIP</h2>
        <p>Extract the ZIP into a new folder. Follow the packaged README to initialize SQLite, start the server and create your first administrator in the browser.</p>
        <a href="https://github.com/vladanPro/legura/releases/download/v0.0.2-pilot.1/legura-0.0.2-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip">Download Windows ZIP <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></a>
        <a
          class="download-checksum"
          href="https://github.com/vladanPro/legura/releases/download/v0.0.2-pilot.1/legura-0.0.2-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip.sha256"
        >Windows SHA-256</a>
      </article>
      <article class="download-card">
        <span class="download-card__label">LINUX / X64</span>
        <h2>Linux tar.gz</h2>
        <p>Tested on Ubuntu 24.04. Extract into a new directory and follow the packaged README to initialize SQLite and run the native server.</p>
        <a href="https://github.com/vladanPro/legura/releases/download/v0.0.2-pilot.1/legura-0.0.2-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz">Download Linux tar.gz <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></a>
        <a
          class="download-checksum"
          href="https://github.com/vladanPro/legura/releases/download/v0.0.2-pilot.1/legura-0.0.2-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz.sha256"
        >Linux SHA-256</a>
      </article>
    </section>
    <section class="section-wrap download-footnote">
      <p><a href="https://github.com/vladanPro/legura/releases/tag/v0.0.2-pilot.1">Release notes and verification</a> · <a href="https://github.com/vladanPro/legura/blob/v0.0.2-pilot.1/docs/installation.md">Build from source</a> · <a href="https://axonyx.dev/">Visit Axonyx</a></p>
    </section>
  }
}
